'''Giovanni''' (Japanese: '''サカキ''' ''Sakaki'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During this turn, attacks used by your Pokémon do +10 damage to your opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

