==Trivia==
* This card's effect is identical to {{TCG|PlusPower}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but as a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} instead of an {{TCGP|Item card}}.
** This card's effect is similar to the effect of the Supporter card {{TCG|Leon}} in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but this card increases damage by 10 instead of 30.
** {{TCG|Giovanni}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but with a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Giovanni]] is a [[Gym Leader]] in [[Kanto]] and the head of [[Team Rocket]]. The interior of the [[Team Rocket Hideout]]'s lowest basement level, as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}, is featured in the regular print's illustration.

